cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, please cite it as below."
title: "How design hazards fake wins in LLM-agent experiments: a simulation study"
abstract: "A Monte Carlo study of how eight design hazards in LLM-agent experiments bias estimated effects and inflate false-positive rates, each paired with the check that catches it. All data are simulated."
authors:
